---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="FAQ | Foam War Parties" description="Answers about DIY rentals, full-service parties, pricing, delivery, booking and safety for foam blaster parties in Southwest Missouri." active={"faq"}>
<section style="position:relative;background:#182B49;color:#fff;padding:20px 0 36px;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center"><img src="/images/foam-lineart.png" alt="" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;filter:invert(1);mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.13">
<div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 55% at 50% 38%,rgba(14,26,46,.92) 0%,rgba(14,26,46,.6) 55%,rgba(14,26,46,0) 100%)">
</div>
<div style="position:relative;max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx);width:100%;text-align:center">
<h1 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,64px);line-height:1;margin:0 0 14px;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(10,20,38,.6)">Frequently Asked <span style="color:#FF7518;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,117,24,.28),0 0 12px rgba(255,117,24,.16)">Questions</span></h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(18px,2.4vw,24px);max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty;text-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(10,20,38,.85),0 0 16px rgba(10,20,38,.7)">Everything you need to know before the battle begins.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#fff;color:#182B49;padding:72px 0">
<div style="max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px">
<div style="display:inline-block;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase">General</div>
</div>
<h2 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 40px;line-height:1;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance"> <span style="color:#FF7518">General</span></h2>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What's the difference between DIY and full service?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">With DIY, you rent the gear and run the games yourself. With full service, we bring everything, set up the battlefield, referee 90 minutes of games and clean up afterward.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What kind of blasters do you use?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Our blasters shoot soft, round foam balls, not darts. We offer standard blasters plus specialty upgrades.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What areas do you serve?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">We're based in Forsyth, Missouri and serve Branson, Springfield and communities across Southwest Missouri.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What kinds of events do you do?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Kids' birthday parties, church youth events, school events, corporate team building, family reunions and community celebrations.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#F3F4F6;color:#182B49;padding:72px 0">
<div style="max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px">
<div style="display:inline-block;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase">DIY Rentals</div>
</div>
<h2 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 40px;line-height:1;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance">DIY <span style="color:#FF7518">Rentals</span></h2>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What comes with the Basic Blaster Package?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">12 foam-ball blasters, 12 pairs of goggles and 960 foam rounds (80 per blaster) for 24 hours, all for $54.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>Can I rent more than 12 blasters?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Yes. Additional blasters are $4 each, and each one includes goggles and 80 foam rounds.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>How long is a DIY rental?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">DIY rentals are for 24 hours.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>Do you deliver?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Yes. Pickup in Forsyth is free. Delivery is $50 for the first 15 miles, plus $4 for each additional mile.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>Can I add barriers and cones?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Yes. Inflatable barriers are $15 each, boundary cones are $0.75 each and whistles are $1.50 each.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#fff;color:#182B49;padding:72px 0">
<div style="max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px">
<div style="display:inline-block;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase">Full-Service Parties</div>
</div>
<h2 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 40px;line-height:1;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance">Full-Service <span style="color:#FF7518">Parties</span></h2>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What's included in a full-service party?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">90 minutes of refereed gameplay, blasters, specialty blasters, goggles, foam ammo, inflatable barriers, organized games, setup and cleanup.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>How much does a full-service party cost?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Standard Battle is $350 for up to 12 participants. Ultimate Battle is $450 for 13–24 participants. Mega Battle is $450 plus $12 for each participant over 24.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>Is there a travel fee?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Parties within 10 miles of Forsyth have no travel fee. After that, it's $20 for each additional 10 miles.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#F3F4F6;color:#182B49;padding:72px 0">
<div style="max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px">
<div style="display:inline-block;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase">Booking &amp; Payment</div>
</div>
<h2 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 40px;line-height:1;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance">Booking &amp; <span style="color:#FF7518">Payment</span></h2>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>How do I reserve my date?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Use our Build Your Party page to price your party, then send us your details. DIY rentals require 50% at booking, with the rest due before equipment is handed over.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>Do I need to sign anything?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Yes. Every rental includes a rental agreement and liability waiver that you'll sign before your party.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What if equipment is lost or damaged?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Renters are responsible for equipment while it's in their care. Lost, missing or damaged items (beyond normal wear and tear) are charged at the reasonable current replacement cost.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#fff;color:#182B49;padding:72px 0">
<div style="max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px">
<div style="display:inline-block;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase">Safety</div>
</div>
<h2 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 40px;line-height:1;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance"> <span style="color:#FF7518">Safety</span></h2>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>Is it safe for kids?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Yes. Every player wears protective goggles, blasters shoot soft foam balls and kids must have adult supervision.</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
<button type="button" data-acc-toggle aria-expanded="false" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:transparent;font-family:inherit;color:#182B49;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px"><span>What are the safety rules?</span><span style="flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px" data-acc-icon aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<div data-acc-panel style="display:none;padding:0 22px 22px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55">Goggles stay on during play, no modifying equipment, only approved foam ammo, no physical fighting, and never aim at people who aren't playing, animals or vehicles. Games must be played away from roads.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="position:relative;color:#fff;padding:calc(80px + clamp(40px,5vw,84px)) 0 80px;text-align:center;z-index:1">
<div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:calc(-1 * clamp(40px,5vw,84px));bottom:0;background:#0875D1;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none;-webkit-mask:url(/images/cloud-mask-up.png) top/100% clamp(40px,5vw,84px) no-repeat,linear-gradient(#000,#000) bottom/100% calc(100% - clamp(40px,5vw,84px) + 4px) no-repeat;mask:url(/images/cloud-mask-up.png) top/100% clamp(40px,5vw,84px) no-repeat,linear-gradient(#000,#000) bottom/100% calc(100% - clamp(40px,5vw,84px) + 4px) no-repeat"><img src="/images/foam-lineart.png" alt="" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;filter:invert(1);mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.16">
</div>
<div style="position:relative;max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<h2 style="text-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(10,20,38,.45);font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1;text-wrap:balance">Still Have <span style="color:#FF7518">Questions?</span></h2>
<p style="font-size:18px;margin:0 0 32px;line-height:1.5">Call or text us. Texting is the fastest way to reach us.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;justify-content:center"><a href="tel:+14175592347" style="background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 28px;border-radius:14px;font-size:18px">Call or Text (417) 559-2347</a><a href="/contact/" style="background:#fff;color:#182B49;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 28px;border-radius:14px;font-size:18px;text-transform:uppercase">Contact Us</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
